[{"answer":"My family and I went on vacation to Lake Huron.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/1.mp3"},{"answer":"The water is beautiful and blue there, and the sand is nice and white.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/2.mp3"},{"answer":"The week that we were there was very hot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/3.mp3"},{"answer":"The sun was hot, but the water was still very cold.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I went swimming and tried to catch little fish in my hands.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I was careful not to get sunburned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/6.mp3"},{"answer":"We stayed at a hotel that had a pool and a game room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I played pinball and video games sometimes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I liked to swim in the hotel pool, but I liked the beach better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I would lie on a big beach towel and get warm,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/10.mp3"},{"answer":"then I would jump in the water and cool off.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes I would just lie on the sand","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and watch the waves roll up on shore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I found some seashells, and saw a crab walking on the sand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/14.mp3"},{"answer":"At first I was a bit lonely because I didn't know anyone there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/15.mp3"},{"answer":"It wasn't long before I met some other kids my age.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/16.mp3"},{"answer":"We built sandcastles together and swam in the lake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/17.mp3"},{"answer":"The other kids were from different towns,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/18.mp3"},{"answer":"so we told each other stories about our schools and friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/19.mp3"},{"answer":"We found that we had a lot in common","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/20.mp3"},{"answer":"even though we were from different places.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Our families got together and went to restaurants together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/22.mp3"},{"answer":"We played volleyball on the beach, and we sat around a campfire at night and sang songs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/23.mp3"},{"answer":"At the campfire we would roast marshmallows on a stick.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I always burn my marshmallows.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/25.mp3"},{"answer":"That is okay. I like them that way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Mostly we just swam in the lake","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/27.mp3"},{"answer":"until we were very tired.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I was sorry when our vacation was over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I had a good time at Lake Huron.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I met some very good friends there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/31.mp3"},{"answer":"We still write to each other.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe we'll see each other next summer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/70-vacation-2019-03-29-12-45-51/33.mp3"}]
